1..15
ok 1 - @a.Bool returns False for empty @a
ok 2 - ?@a returns False for empty @a
ok 3 - @a in bool context returns False for empty @a
ok 4 - @a.Bool returns True for @a with one element
ok 5 - ?@a returns True for @a with one element
ok 6 - @a in bool context returns True for @a with one element
ok 7 - @a.Bool returns True for @a with two elements
ok 8 - ?@a returns True for @a with two elements
ok 9 - @a in bool context returns True for @a with two elements
ok 10 - @a.Bool returns False for empty range in @a
ok 11 - ?@a returns False for empty range in @a
ok 12 - @a in bool context returns False for empty range in @a
ok 13 - @a.Bool returns True for non-empty range in @a
ok 14 - ?@a returns True for non-empty range in @a
ok 15 - @a in bool context returns True for non-empty range in @a
